stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OPEN: reportFault
  OPEN --> ASSIGNED: ASSIGN to ACTIVE MAINTAINER
  ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS: START by assigned MAINTAINER
  IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS: diagnosis, repair action or note; audit only
  IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED: RESOLVE with note and time
  IN_PROGRESS --> UNREPAIRABLE: MARK_UNREPAIRABLE with note and time
  RESOLVED --> [*]
  UNREPAIRABLE --> [*]
  note right of OPEN
    Direct report blocks Equipment as UNDER_MAINTENANCE.
    UC03 damaged return on RETIRED preserves RETIRED
    and directly inserts a linked OPEN case plus audit.
    OPEN queue does not include ASSIGNED or IN_PROGRESS.
  end note
  note right of IN_PROGRESS
    Only assigned MAINTAINER may work or complete.
    Work entries do not update case version.
    OPEN, ASSIGNED and IN_PROGRESS all block reservation/issue.
  end note
  note right of RESOLVED
    Persist terminal case before Equipment recomputation.
    RETIRED remains RETIRED.
    Another active case keeps UNDER_MAINTENANCE.
    Otherwise ACTIVE loan keeps ON_LOAN.
    Otherwise Equipment becomes AVAILABLE.
    No further domain transition or work.
  end note
  note right of UNREPAIRABLE
    Equipment becomes RETIRED.
    Retirement cannot be reversed.
    No further domain transition or work.
  end note
  %% D-008: Reported = OPEN; Not Repairable = UNREPAIRABLE.
  %% Proposal Closed is folded into both terminal outcomes; no CLOSED endpoint/state.
  %% V002 does not make every terminal case column immutable on same-status SQL updates.
